  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>CryptPad's Kanban app is like a board of sticky notes. Arrange tasks by completion stage, or maintain a situation board for your unit.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "slideset",
      "source": "canonical",
      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Create a Kanban board",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Click <strong>+</strong> and select <strong>Kanban</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/a2efd8a3607bc944.webp",
              "width": 1356,
              "height": 1170
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Edit the board",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Create columns for workflow stages and add cards for tasks. Shown here is an example task-completion tracking board.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/b8949f211da2411e.webp",
              "width": 1972,
              "height": 791
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Manage task cards",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Click a card to add details. You can also add images to cards. Drag and drop cards between columns to update their status.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/16b9fe15c2fbec04.webp",
              "width": 1978,
              "height": 1026
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Situation board",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>The Kanban app can also be used as a situation board. Track units' mission progress, tasks, and the enemy situation in cards, and share your surface picture with the command centre.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/c5fbd98a6a588076.webp",
              "width": 1805,
              "height": 1148
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
